<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>7 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza), Marcello</p>
<p>Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>5 - Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria)</p>
<p>4 - Oliver Bierhoff and Paolo Poggi (both Udinese), Enrico</p>
<p>Chiesa (Parma), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
<p>3 - Roberto Baggio and Marco Simone (both Milan), Gabriel</p>
<p>Batistuta (Fiorentina), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Igor Kolyvanov</p>
<p>and Carlo Nervo (both Bologna), Marco Negri (Perugia), Michele</p>
<p>Padovano (Juventus), Javier Zanetti (Inter)</p>
</text>
